{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">美國軍方證實，早前長期部署中東的林肯號航母，有八名水兵在壓力下試圖輕生。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.US.LINCOLN-1830.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026ekScEZfgxX1790245784.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.US.LINCOLN-1830.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">美國代理海軍部長高雄致函聯邦參議員的信中，提到林肯號航母部署近九個月以來，共有八名水兵試圖自殺未遂，統計範圍包括艦載航空聯隊、打擊群和驅逐艦中隊參謀人員等。他指這數字並非異常之高，又補充道打擊群部署期間，沒有軍人因自殺身亡，並強調官兵在嚴峻條件下，展現了非凡的決心。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.US.LINCOLN-1830_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026qQEtPkCc0t1790245803.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.US.LINCOLN-1830_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">此前有報道指，林肯號航母出現物資短缺，廁所爆水管，以及軍人心理健康等問題。美國總統特朗普曾表示，此次部署時間還不夠長。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-24T10:59:52.121958+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":230,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}